    id: "ai-in-business-software",
    title: "How AI Is Transforming Business Software in 2026",
    slug: "ai-in-business-software",
    description: "How businesses are actually using AI in software: assistants, document processing, predictive analytics and automation, plus the real risks to weigh.",
